mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run by run, generate good-will with your riders to unlock new buses, visual styles and upgrades. Whether you prefer a relaxing driving experience or want to master and optimize every detail of your runs–sit behind the wheel and make your trip your own.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Step into the driver’s seat in Bus Bound, the latest title from the creators of Bus Simulator 21. Explore a vibrant city behind the wheel of officially licensed buses, and help transform it into a pedestrian-friendly paradise—one stop at a time.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Czech, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Turkish, Welsh<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Bus Bound is such a relaxing and chill experience”<br>Analog Stick Gaming<br><br>“A great simulator with easy-to-understand mechanics and satisfying driving controls”<br>Games Hedge<br><br>“My favourite simulator in some time”<br>LootLevelChill<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095420/9803e0013dffba0e3e2577691ec09196046bce99/header.jpg?t=1786021215", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095420/97866de3ef8943b26e713eddf58d2cbc3fed6b7d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786021215", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095420/97866de3ef8943b26e713eddf58d2cbc3fed6b7d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786021215", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-10600k / Ryzen 5 3600x<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1070 8gb VRA